# Normalise text to LF everywhere, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Session fixtures are hashed byte for byte. Replay digests, plan digests and
# every test that pins one depend on these exact bytes, so Git must never
# rewrite their line endings: with the usual Windows default
# (core.autocrlf=true) a fresh checkout would otherwise compute different
# digests from the same commit.
tests/fixtures/** -text

*.png binary
*.gif binary
